---
const softSkills = [
  "Problem Solving",
  "Critical Thinking",
  "System Analysis",
  "Kolaborasi Tim",
  "Manajemen Waktu",
  "Public Speaking",
  "Desain & Visualisasi",
  "Microsoft Office",
];
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Left Column: Narrative -->
      <div class="about-narrative">
        <div class="section-tag">TENTANG SAYA</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Profil & Nilai Tambah</h2>
        
        <p class="about-lead">
          Lulusan S1 Teknik Informatika <strong>Universitas 17 Agustus 1945 Surabaya</strong> dengan dedikasi pada rekayasa perangkat lunak dan keandalan sistem.
        </p>

        <p class="about-text">
          Berpengalaman sebagai <strong>Full-Stack Developer</strong> untuk berbagai sistem informasi dan aplikasi web komersial, didukung sertifikasi resmi <strong>BNSP Junior Web Programmer</strong>. Komunikatif dalam menerjemahkan kebutuhan bisnis ke arsitektur teknis, adaptif terhadap perkembangan teknologi, dan terbiasa bekerja mandiri maupun kolaboratif dalam tim.
        </p>

        <div class="career-quote">
          <p class="quote-text font-mono">
            &gt; "Terus berkembang di bidang rekayasa perangkat lunak untuk menghadirkan solusi digital yang efisien, skalabel, dan berdampak positif."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="soft-skills-wrapper">
          <h3 class="subsection-title font-mono">// SOFT SKILLS & ANALISIS</h3>
          <div class="skills-chips">
            {softSkills.map((skill) => (
              <span class="skill-chip">{skill}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Minimalist Monochrome Spec Terminal -->
      <div class="about-terminal-col">
        <div class="terminal-card">
          <div class="terminal-header font-mono">
            <span class="terminal-name">whoami.sh</span>
            <span class="terminal-status">[READY]</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body font-mono">
            <div class="term-line"><span class="prompt">$</span> cat developer_profile.txt</div>
            <div class="term-data">
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">NAME:</span>
                <span class="t-val">Surya Asael</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">DEGREE:</span>
                <span class="t-val">S1 Informatika, UNTAG Surabaya</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">GPA:</span>
                <span class="t-val">3.62 / 4.00</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">ROLE:</span>
                <span class="t-val">Full-Stack Web Developer</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">CORE:</span>
                <span class="t-val">Laravel, React.js, MySQL, Tailwind</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">CERT:</span>
                <span class="t-val">BNSP Junior Web Programmer</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">LOCATION:</span>
                <span class="t-val">Surabaya / Gresik, Jawa Timur</span>
              </div>
              <div class="term-row">
                <span class="t-key">STATUS:</span>
                <span class="t-val t-highlight">AVAILABLE FOR HIRE</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="term-cursor-line">
              <span class="prompt">sael@portfolio:~$</span>
              <span class="term-block-cursor"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="principles-box">
          <div class="principle-title font-mono">// PRINSIP KERJA</div>
          <p class="principle-desc">
            Menulis kode yang bersih (*clean code*), struktur database yang ternormalisasi, performa rendering yang optimal, serta dokumentasi sistem yang jelas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: 90px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .career-quote {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--text-primary);
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .subsection-title {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .skills-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .skill-chip {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .skill-chip:hover {
    border-color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  /* Monochrome Terminal */
  .terminal-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .terminal-header {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: 20px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .term-line {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }

  .term-data {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .term-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 90px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .t-key {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .t-val {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .t-highlight {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .term-cursor-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
  }

  .term-block-cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 8px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--text-primary);
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .principles-box {
    margin-top: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .principle-title {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .principle-desc {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
